# List all source types

The catalog of sources a data flow can extract from — read from the live Data Integration API, so a
new source appears here with no provider release.

## How it works

Each entry's `id` is the value to use as a data flow's `properties.source.name`. `connection_type`
tells you which `boomi_data_integration_connection` type that source binds to, and `status` flags
whether it's currently enabled. This is the source-side counterpart to
[`boomi_data_integration_target_types`](./data_integration_target_types) — most integrations need to
check both.

